---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Legal
  title="Terms of Service"
  updated={site.legal.updated}
  meta={`Applies to · ${site.storeName} for iOS`}
  description="Terms of Service for Puzzle Farming: Harvest Loop — a coding puzzle game by KomKat Studio for iPhone and iPad."
>
  <div class="legal__panel">
    <h2>The short version</h2>
    <ul class="legal__checks">
      <li>Harvest Loop is licensed for personal, non-commercial use on Apple devices.</li>
      <li>Optional in-app purchases unlock extra content — all sales are final per Apple's policies.</li>
      <li>Pip, the art, music, and code are owned by {site.studioLegal}.</li>
      <li>The game is educational entertainment — not a formal curriculum or certification.</li>
      <li>Apple's standard EULA also applies to your use of the iOS app.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <h2>1 · Agreement</h2>
  <p>
    By downloading, installing, or using {site.storeName} ("the App"), you agree to these Terms of Service
    ("Terms"). If you do not agree, do not use the App. These Terms are between you and {site.studioLegal}
    ("we", "us", "our").
  </p>

  <h2>2 · License</h2>
  <p>
    We grant you a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to use the App on Apple-branded
    devices that you own or control, subject to the Usage Rules in the Apple Media Services Terms and Conditions.
    You may not copy, modify, distribute, sell, or lease any part of the App, nor reverse engineer or attempt
    to extract the source code, except as permitted by applicable law.
  </p>

  <h2>3 · Apple EULA</h2>
  <p>
    The App is made available through the Apple App Store. Your use of the App is also subject to Apple's
    Licensed Application End User License Agreement. In the event of a conflict between these Terms and
    Apple's EULA, Apple's EULA governs with respect to your relationship with Apple.
  </p>

  <h2>4 · In-app purchases</h2>
  <p>
    The App offers optional in-app purchases processed by Apple:
  </p>
  <ul class="legal__items">
    <li><strong>Full Game Unlock</strong> — a one-time purchase that removes the free-level limit for endless runs.</li>
    <li><strong>Extra Hearts</strong> — a consumable purchase that refills hearts after game over.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    All purchases are final except as required by applicable law or Apple's refund policies. Prices may change
    without notice. Restore purchases is available through the App for non-consumable items.
  </p>

  <h2>5 · Game Center</h2>
  <p>
    Optional Game Center features, including leaderboards, are provided by Apple. Your use of Game Center is
    subject to Apple's terms. We are not responsible for Game Center availability or Apple's handling of your data.
  </p>

  <h2>6 · Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>You agree not to:</p>
  <ul class="legal__items">
    <li>Use the App for any unlawful purpose or in violation of these Terms.</li>
    <li>Attempt to cheat, exploit bugs, or interfere with the App's operation or other players' experience.</li>
    <li>Reverse engineer, decompile, or disassemble the App except as permitted by law.</li>
    <li>Remove or alter any copyright, trademark, or proprietary notices.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>7 · Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    The App, including all characters (including Pip), artwork, voxel designs, command-block visuals, music,
  sound effects, code, and trademarks, is owned by {site.studioLegal} and protected by copyright and other
    intellectual property laws. These Terms do not grant you any rights to our trademarks or brand assets.
  </p>

  <h2>8 · Educational disclaimer</h2>
  <p>
    Harvest Loop teaches programming concepts through play. It is designed as educational entertainment for
    families and is not a formal coding curriculum, certification program, or substitute for structured
    computer-science education. We make no guarantees about specific learning outcomes.
  </p>

  <h2>9 · Disclaimer of warranties</h2>
  <p>
    THE APP IS PROVIDED "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE" WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, WHETHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED,
    INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, AND
    NON-INFRINGEMENT. WE DO NOT WARRANT THAT THE APP WILL BE UNINTERRUPTED, ERROR-FREE, OR FREE OF HARMFUL
    COMPONENTS.
  </p>

  <h2>10 · Limitation of liability</h2>
