    Continued use of the App after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.
  </p>

  <h2>13 · Governing law</h2>
  <p>
    These Terms are governed by the laws of Vietnam, without regard to conflict-of-law principles. Any disputes
    shall be resolved in the courts of competent jurisdiction in Vietnam, except where mandatory consumer
    protection laws in your country provide otherwise.
  </p>

  <div class="legal__contact">
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about these Terms? Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Legal>
